                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele basalali ba-Sijulu wamajulu bayootambula bwami, nkabela bayoovuba bwami lyoonse mane kukabe kutamani.",
          "type": "text",
