        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo ndakayandisya kuziba makani aamunyama wane, iwakaandeene abamwi boonse, uuyoosya loko, uuli ameno aalubulo amaala aamukuba, iwakali kulya akutyolaula akulyataula zisyeede ansumba zyakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
