              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mbuboobu mbwaakaamba. Munyama wane, nkokuti kuyoobuka bwami bwane ansi ano bwaandeene amami amwi oonse. Obo bwami buyoolya nyika yoonse, buyooilyataula akwiityolaula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
