                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameja aali ikumi, nkokuti kubwami obo kuyoobuka bami bali ikumi, alimwi kusule lyabaabo kuyoobuka umbi uuandeene aboonse bakutaanguna, nkabela uyoozunda bami botatwe. ",
          "type": "text",
