              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele kuyooba inkuta yakubeteka makani, elyo bweendelezi bwakwe buyoonyanzigwa, kuti bunyonyoonwe akulobesegwa mane kusikila kumamanino. ",
          "type": "text",
