        {
          "text": "Lino bwami abweendelezi abupati bwazisi zyoonse zyaansi, zyoonse ziyooabwa mumaanza aabantu babasalali ba-Sijulu, Bwami bwakwe mbwami buteeli, nkabela misyobo yoonse iyoomulemeka akumumanina milimo.",
